# Files description
------------------------------------------------------------------------
All the files created in OneSTOP are stored in the Zenodo repository [link]
- sp_general_info_clean.csv: contains basic information for the IUCN RL species assessments of the study species. 
- mapped_IUCN_RL_sp_taxa.csv: contains all the species' names checked against the GBIF backbone, following wiSDM 2.0
- mapped_IUCN_RL_sp_accepted_taxonkeys.txt: contains all the species' taxonomic keys (to use on GBIF) checked against the GBIF backbone, following wiSDM 2.0
- IUCN_RL_sp_occurrences_raw.qs: contains all the species' raw occurrences downloaded using rgbif R package, following wiSDM 2.0
- IUCN_RL_sp_occurrences_cleaned.1981.cea.wgs84.qs: contains all the species' cleaned, filtered occurrences (after 1981) downloaded using rgbif R package, following wiSDM 2.0
- global.occ.cea.wgs84.LL_v02.csv: contains all the coordinate of the pseudo-presences sampled for the study species. For the pseudo-presences sampling process, refer to OneSTOP 5.4 Milestone.

